description 1 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/1".

description 1 is a legal rule.

description 1 has the label "Article 9 – Budget performance monitoring and reporting".

description 1 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/545/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_545/FINAL/eng/art_9".

description 1 has the digital dimension data.

description 1 involves the process data collection.

description 1 produces item 1 action.

description 1 has the description "The Commission shall monitor the implementation of the programmes financed by the budget, in all methods of implementation, to assess the progress made towards the achievement of their objectives in accordance with the performance indicators listed in Annex I to the Regulation. The data shall be collected regularly and stored electronically.".


description 2 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/2".

description 2 is a legal rule.

description 2 has the label "Article 12 – Transparency Single Gateway".

description 2 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/545/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_545/FINAL/eng/art_12".

description 2 has the digital dimension data.

description 2 involves the process data collection publication.

description 2 produces item 2 action.

description 2 references item the single portal shall contain publish data onthe activities.

description 2 has the description "The Article lays down provisions aiming at creating a single portal to make publicly accessible performance information as well as data on beneficiaries and operations supported by the budget, and information on available funding opportunities.".


description 3 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/3".

description 3 is a legal rule.

description 3 has the label "Article 14 – Implementation through plans by Member States – performance monitoring and, reporting".

description 3 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/545/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_545/FINAL/eng/art_14".

description 3 has the digital dimension data.

description 3 involves the process data collection monitoring.

description 3 produces item 3 action.

description 3 has the description "Each Member State shall have a monitoring and reporting system to allow for monitoring of performance and the automated transmission of information on expenditure tracking and performance framework. This system shall be interoperable and allow for an automatic electronic data exchange with the Single Gateway and the electronic data exchange system between the Member States and the Commission. Member States plans shall contain provisions on reporting of performance data and the electronic transmission to the Commission of the underlying monitoring data.".


description 4 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/4".

description 4 is a legal rule.

description 4 has the label "Article 17 – Implementation under indirect management".

description 4 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/545/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_545/FINAL/eng/art_17".

description 4 has the digital dimension data.

description 4 involves the process data collection monitoring.

description 4 produces item 4 action.

description 4 has the description "Agreements signed between persons or entities implementing Union funds and the Commission shall contain provisions on transmitting electronically to the Commission information in relation to calls, by the day of their publication.".


description 5 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/5".

description 5 is a legal rule.

description 5 has the label "Article 18 – Information, communication and visibility".

description 5 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/545/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_545/FINAL/eng/art_18".

description 5 involves the process c 1 cd 39254 c 5 a 5.

description 5 produces item 5 action.

description 5 has the description "Beneficiaries, persons or entities implementing Union funds, bodies implementing financial instruments under the plans, and advisory partners shall acknowledge the origin of those funds and ensure the visibility of the Union support, in particular when promoting the actions and their results, such as through websites and other digital channels".


description 6 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/6".

description 6 is a legal rule.

description 6 has the label "Article 19 – Processing of personal data".

description 6 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/545/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_545/FINAL/eng/art_19".

description 6 has the digital dimension data.

description 6 involves the process data processing.

description 6 produces item 6 action.

description 6 references processing of personal data.

description 6 has the description "The Member States and the Commission shall be allowed to process personal data. When processing the personal data, technical and organisational measures shall be in place to safeguard the rights of the data subjects.".


