item the single portal shall contain publish data onthe activities conforms to this data should be published by the commission through.

item the single portal shall contain publish data onthe activities has the title "The single portal shall contain and publish data on:the activities financed by the budget, including on the progress of the financial implementation and performance, broken down by programme and by chapter of a plan by a Member State where relevant;information on aggregated performance broken down by programme and intervention field, using the relevant performance indicators;information on contribution towards policies such as green, social and gender equality;operations financed by the budget;for activities implemented directly by the Commission, the level of subscription, in particular the number of proposals and per call for proposals, their average score, the share of proposals above and below quality thresholds;information referred to in Article 41(3), point (h) of Regulation (EU, Euratom) 2024/2509.".


